{"id":21060,"artist":"Noel Regney Gloria Shayn","title":"Do You Hear What I Hear","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:08.82] Said the night wind to the little lamb,\n[00:14.12] do you see what I see\n[00:18.82] Way up in the sky, little lamb,\n[00:23.53] do you see what I see\n[00:27.94] A star, a star, dancing in the night\n[00:32.35] With a tail as big as a kite\n[00:37.06] With a tail as big as a kite\n[00:44.12] Said the little lamb to the shepherd boy,\n[00:49.41] do you hear what I hear\n[00:54.12] Ringing through the sky, shepherd boy,\n[00:58.82] do you hear what I hear\n[01:03.24] A song, a song, high above the trees\n[01:07.65] With a voice as big as the sea\n[01:12.35] With a voice as big as the sea\n[01:19.41] Said the shepherd boy to the mighty king,\n[01:24.71] do you know what I know\n[01:29.41] In your palace warm, mighty king,\n[01:34.12] do you know what I know\n[01:38.53] A Child, a Child shivers in the cold\n[01:42.94] Let us bring Him silver and gold\n[01:47.65] Let us bring Him silver and gold\n[01:54.71] Said the king to the people ev'rywhere,\n[01:60.00] listen to what I say\n[02:04.71] Pray for peace, people every-where,\n[02:09.41] listen to what I say\n[02:13.82] The Child, the Child, sleeping in the night\n[02:18.24] He will bring us goodness and light\n[02:22.94] He will bring us goodness and light\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:08.82] <00:08.82>Said <00:09.11>the <00:09.41>night <00:09.99>wind <00:10.58>to <00:10.88>the <00:11.17>litt <00:11.47>le <00:11.76>lamb,\n[00:14.11] <00:14.11>do <00:14.41>you <00:14.70>see <00:14.99>what <00:15.29>I <00:15.88>see\n[00:18.82] <00:18.82>Way <00:19.11>up <00:19.41>in <00:19.70>the <00:19.99>sky, <00:20.58>litt <00:20.88>le <00:21.17>lamb,\n[00:23.52] <00:23.52>do <00:23.82>you <00:24.11>see <00:24.41>what <00:24.70>I <00:25.29>see\n[00:27.94] <00:27.94>A <00:28.23>star, <00:29.11>a <00:29.41>star, <00:30.58>danc <00:30.88>ing <00:31.17>in <00:31.47>the <00:31.76>night\n[00:32.35] <00:32.35>